    "chunk_text": "significat linene cla\u00f0as waxan gesih\u00f0 hearm getacna\u00fe. Lineam uestem uestire aliquam egritudinem significat linen reaf scredan sume seocnysse getacna\u00fe. Leonem currentem uiderit, expeditionem negotii significat leon yrnende gesih\u00f0 fer\u00f0runge ceapas Leonem dormientem uiderit malignum negotium significat leon sl\u00e6pende gesih\u00f0 awyrigedne cep Leonem infestare inimici seditionem significat leon wedan feondes gestric getacna\u00fe. Legatum se uiderit inpeditionem significat \u00e6rendraca gesih\u00f0 lettige getacna\u00fe. Luminaria trectare infirmitatem significat leohtfatu handlian untrumnysse getacna\u00fe. Luminaria se uiderit securitatem significat leohtfatu hine gesih\u00f0 orsorhnysse getacna\u00fe. Lapides mittere egritudinem significat stanes asendan seocnesse getacna\u00fe. Litigare in somnis negotii incrementum significat cidan on swefnum ceapes eacan getacna\u00fe. Lectum sibi stratum & bene stratum uiderit claritatem significat bed him gestreht & wel gestreht Mare placidum uiderit negotii expeditionem significat s\u00e6 smylte gesih\u00f0 ceapas fyr\u00f0runge getacna\u00fe. Maris pisces uiderit anxietatem grauem significat s\u00e6fixas gesih\u00f0 anxsumnysse hefige getacna\u00fe. Manus sibi inquinatas uiderit opera iniqua significat handa him befylde gesih\u00f0 weorca unrihte Matrem suam mortuam aut uiuam uiderit, gaudium significat moder his deade o\u00f0\u00f0e cucu gesih\u00f0 Maiorem se uiderit, gaudium minus est & detrimentum significat maran hine gesih\u00f0 blisse l\u00e6sse hit Mulierem sparsis crinibus se u",
